    "description": "Photograph by Liat Portal documenting a mixed vegetable salad served in a white bowl. The salad includes lettuce, spinach leaves, cherry tomatoes, cucumber, red onion, orange, red bell peppers, and visible fresh herbs. The image records raw ingredient state, whole food preparation, home scale food assembly, plant-based nutrition, and ingredient-level food documentation within the Foodie Disorder archive. The vegetables are shown freshly chopped and combined without visible heavy processing, reflecting minimal processing and everyday domestic food preparation."
